# Max 200 lines per file

Never write or leave a source file longer than **200 lines**.

- Split by component, section, locale, hook, or utility when approaching the limit
- Prefer many focused files over one large module
- Styles: split by page/section; avoid dumping all CSS into one file
- Translations: one locale file (or section file) per language chunk if needed

```text
❌ BAD: HomePage.tsx with hero + pricing + FAQ + footer (400+ lines)
✅ GOOD: Hero.tsx, Pricing.tsx, Faq.tsx, Footer.tsx each under 200 lines
```

Before finishing an edit, count lines. If over 200, extract code into a new file first.
